## Command Reference

### 🚀 Startup
```bash
npm start                           # Full orchestrated boot (dev mode)
npm run start:cloud                 # Cloud: server + bridge only
npm run start:local                 # Local: all services
pm2 start ecosystem.config.cjs     # Direct PM2 start
```

### 📊 Monitoring
```bash
npm run check                       # One-shot health check
npm run watch                       # Continuous watchdog
npm run status                      # PM2 service status
pm2 logs                            # Live logs
pm2 logs ghostnet-bridge            # Single service logs
```

### 🛑 Stop
```bash
npm run stop                        # Orchestrated shutdown
pm2 stop all                        # PM2 stop
pm2 delete all                      # Full cleanup
```

