## Self-Healing Safeguards

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["Service Fails"] --> B{"Watchdog Detects<br/>3 consecutive fails"}
    B -->|Yes| C["PM2 Auto-Restart"]
    B -->|No| D["Log & Continue<br/>Monitoring"]
    C --> E{"Service Recovers?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["✅ Back to Healthy"]
    E -->|No| G["Max 10 restarts<br/>then flag error"]
    G --> H["Other services<br/>remain operational"]
```

- **PM2 layer**: `autorestart: true`, `max_restarts: 10`, `restart_delay: 2-3s`
- **Watchdog layer**: Port + HTTP + WS checks every 30s, auto-restart after 3 failures
- **Memory guard**: Services restart if exceeding 200-300MB RSS
- **Stale peer cleanup**: WebSocket peers pruned after 90s silence
- **Isolated failures**: Bridge BTC/ETH failures don't crash bridge process

